  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the participation of representatives from Least Developed Countries in meetings of the Commission on Genetic for Food and Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen global policies, programmes and other instruments on genetic resources and biodiversity for food and agriculture by facilitating the participation of Commission Members and representatives from relevant non-governmental organizations from Least Developed Countries in meetings mandated by the Commission. Specifically, this project will fund travel related costs for participants from Least Developed Countries to participate in the Global Pollinator Conference (16-17 September 2026, Rome, Italy) and the Fourteenth Session of the Intergovernmental Technical Working Group on Animal Genetic Resources for Food and Agriculture (25-27 November 2026, Rome, Italy).</narrative>
  </description>
